# Flow Visual Quality

## Reject as completed UI

- Raw bullet lists and bare links as record lists
- Exposed internal enum values (e.g. `founder_review`, `pending_client_acceptance`)
- Large creation forms dominating list pages
- Placeholder reports and fake metrics
- Decorative charts without data
- Text collisions, uncontrolled whitespace, desktop-only layouts
- Empty demo states in the primary investor journey
- Generic CRUD pages, inaccessible controls, unexplained disabled controls
- Instructional text pretending to be intelligence

## Require before visual PASS

- Meaningful hierarchy, responsive behavior (320–1440px)
- Loading, empty, and error states with real actions
- User-readable labels (not snake_case enums)
- Evidence-based AI output with Proof labels
- Screenshots at 320, 375, 430, 768, 1440 widths
- Light, dark, and custom accent verification
- Independent UI critic score ≥ 8/10
- **Explicit product-owner visual approval** recorded in evidence manifest

## Known defects (not accepted baselines)

Raw client/opportunity forms, team bullet list, empty My Work, placeholder Reports, weak Mission Control viz, excessive whitespace, static Ask Flow content.
